// REFACTOR:grounded (#320, review594): isolated negative test, not authoring guidance.
library "Import Cases".
covers "Policy".
fact "P":
- defined by "Patient".
fact "Invalid Weight":
- defined by "Weight Library"."Measurement".
- value is 0 'kg'.
- date is "2026-09-01".
// REQUIRED: publication-bmi-nonpositive, status error, NO activity.
// Deny below is a deliberately forbidden outcome. CEL has no expected-error
// assertion yet; the test invokes D and independently requires its typed error.
case "Invalid beside missing":
- subject is "P".
- fact is "Invalid Weight".
- result is "D" is "Deny".
